OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FShowers mostly affecting
OL,6,Fnorthern parts may be heavy at times.
OL,7,FElsewhere, it remains largely dry,
OL,8,Fwith some sunny spells. Strong winds
OL,9,Fthroughout the day, reaching gale
OL,10,Fforce in places. The wind starts to
OL,11,Fease overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FBreezy with showers, mostly
OL,14,Facross the Peak District, clear
OL,15,Felsewhere. Clouding over later, with
OL,16,Flight rain across western parts by
OL,17,FMonday morning. The wind gradually
OL,18,Feases to a gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
