OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FRain moves northeast during
OL,6,Fthe morning and clears by mid-
OL,7,Fafternoon. It stays dry but cloudy for
OL,8,Fthe rest of the day, with the wind
OL,9,Fstrengthening once more.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FShowers soon clear to give sunny
OL,13,Fspells, but it stays breezy on
OL,14,FTuesday. Breezy with showers on
OL,15,FWednesday. Foggy Thursday morning,
OL,16,Fbrighter later, with lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
